**Gate all inventory mutation commands for Spectator.**
`toggleInventory`, eating, potions, placement, and attacks now respect `canInteract`, but direct dispatch can still `craft`, `swapSlots`, `moveStack`, `toggleEquipArmor`, or `enchant` in Spectator. Keep the engine command surface aligned with “Spectator has no inventory.”
